{% doc %}
  schema.org JSON-LD in a <script type="application/ld+json">.

  Types:
  - 'organization': the chain, as an Organization (home page, from layout/theme.liquid):
    name = the theme's brand name (settings.brand_name, e.g. JOY Mobile), alternateName =
    the Hebrew name from the locale file (general.meta.alternate_name, ג׳וי מובייל), url,
    logo (settings.logo → the JOY Mobile lockup assets/logo-joy.png; the shop-level Brand
    logo is deliberately not used), description (general.meta.default_description), phone
    in +972 form and email from the theme settings, the address of the theme settings
    (street/city/postal code, IL), a customer-service ContactPoint, sameAs = the social
    links, the return policy (below) and `department` = every branch as a store
    (snippets/branches-json.liquid: the facts and ids of the branches page), so an engine
    that reads the home page learns every location, phone and opening hours.
  - 'website': WebSite + SearchAction (/search?q=…), named after the brand, with the Hebrew
    name as alternateName (Google reads both as the site name). Home page.
  - 'product': Product — name, description (plain text), up to 8 images, sku, brand (the
    vendor; left out when it is the store itself, "joy mobile", or the brand name,
    compared case-insensitively), category (the product type, POS department codes such
    as "א.מכשירים" spelled out), color (below), url, and one Offer per variant with a price above zero: price in shekels as a
    decimal (the Eilat price actually charged), priceCurrency, priceValidUntil (30 days from
    the render: prices follow the POS and have no end date, and a rolling date never goes
    stale in a cached page), availability (InStock / OutOfStock), itemCondition, url with
    ?variant=, sku, the GTIN, the seller (the Organization), the return policy, and
    availableAtOrFrom = every branch, as a reference to its store node by the same @id
    (<origin>/#store-<id>, snippets/branch-json; the ids are read from
    snippets/branches-json, so a branch added there is offered here too). With the theme
    setting schema_pickup_only (off by default: turn it on only once checkout offers no shipping) also
    availableDeliveryMethod OnSitePickup and shippingDetails with doesNotShip to IL.
    A single-variant product also carries its GTIN.
    - color: the selected variant's value of the colour option (the option names snippets/swatches
      reads), else, without a colour option, the colour words of the title in title order
      ("שחור/אפור", "טיטניום טבעי"), from the colour vocabulary of snippets/accessory-model.
      "כהה", "בהיר", "טבעי" and "מדברי" only count next to a colour, a colour right after "מתג"
      is a keyboard switch, and the band names מילנז/מילנזי are not colours.
      No ProductGroup / inProductGroupWithID: the catalogue has no stable key that joins the
      colour siblings of one model, and a key guessed from the title would group wrong products.
    - GTIN: the variant barcode only when it is a real GS1 number — 8, 12, 13 or 14 digits
      with a valid check digit — as gtin8/gtin12/gtin13/gtin14. The store's internal codes
      ("6661", "432344") and part numbers ("MGDR4HB/A") never become GTINs.
    - itemCondition: UsedCondition for the tag "יד שניה" (or "יד שנייה"),
      RefurbishedCondition for "מחודש" — the tags behind the collection "מכשירים יד שניה
      ומחודשים" — else NewCondition.
    - No review or rating markup: the store has no reviews, and ratings may only describe
      reviews that are visible on the page.
    Printed once, in the <head> (layout/theme.liquid, placement: 'head'), so it doesn't
    depend on the product section's markup. A call without that placement prints
    nothing, so a section that still renders this type can't add a second Product.
  - 'breadcrumbs': BreadcrumbList — delegates to the breadcrumbs snippet so the
    JSON-LD always matches the visible trail.
  - 'article': BlogPosting for the current article.

  Return policy (MerchantReturnPolicy, on the Organization and on every Offer): the
  cancellation terms of the live store, under the Consumer Protection Law — 14 days from
  receiving the product, the product returned to the store (ReturnInStore); a cancellation
  that isn't due to a defect is at the customer's expense (ReturnFeesCustomerResponsibility;
  its handling fee, 5% or ₪100 whichever is lower, has no schema.org form and is left out),
  while a defective product is taken back free (itemDefectReturnFees FreeReturn).
  merchantReturnLink: the Hebrew page "ביטול עסקה והחזרת מוצרים" (handle returns), else
  Shopify's refund policy — the same rule as the footer's link.

  Other structured data lives with its content: the branches page's stores in
  sections/branches.liquid, the FAQ page's questions in sections/faq.liquid.
  Every value is JSON-encoded and "</" is written as "<\/" (same string in JSON), so content
  can never close the script.

  @param {string} type - 'organization' | 'website' | 'product' | 'breadcrumbs' | 'article'.
  @param {product} [product] - Product for 'product'. Default: the page's product.
  @param {string} [placement] - 'head' when layout/theme.liquid renders the 'product' type; the only placement that prints it.
  @param {article} [article] - Article for 'article'. Default: the page's article.

  @example
  {% render 'structured-data', type: 'organization' %}
  {% render 'structured-data', type: 'product', product: product, placement: 'head' %}
{% enddoc %}
{%- liquid
  assign site_url = request.origin
  assign org_id = site_url | append: '/#organization'
  assign brand_name = settings.brand_name | strip | default: shop.name
-%}
{%- capture return_policy_json -%}
  {%- if type == 'organization' or type == 'product' -%}
    {%- assign return_policy_url = pages['returns'].url | default: shop.refund_policy.url -%}
    {"@type":"MerchantReturnPolicy","applicableCountry":"IL","returnPolicyCategory":"https://schema.org/MerchantReturnFiniteReturnWindow","merchantReturnDays":14,"returnMethod":"https://schema.org/ReturnInStore","returnFees":"https://schema.org/ReturnFeesCustomerResponsibility","itemDefectReturnFees":"https://schema.org/FreeReturn"
    {%- if return_policy_url != blank -%},"merchantReturnLink":{{ site_url | append: return_policy_url | json }}{%- endif -%}}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- case type -%}
  {%- when 'breadcrumbs' -%}
    {%- render 'breadcrumbs', format: 'json' -%}

  {%- when 'organization' -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign org_logo = settings.logo
      assign same_as = ''
      assign networks = 'facebook,instagram,telegram,tiktok,youtube' | split: ','
      for network in networks
        assign setting_key = 'social_' | append: network | append: '_link'
        if settings[setting_key] != blank
          assign same_as = same_as | append: '|' | append: settings[setting_key]
        endif
      endfor
      assign same_as_list = same_as | remove_first: '|' | split: '|'

      assign org_alternate_name = 'general.meta.alternate_name' | t | strip
      assign org_description = 'general.meta.default_description' | t: brand: brand_name
      assign org_email = settings.contact_email | strip
      # 03-511-7171 → +972-3-511-7171: Google asks for the country code.
      assign org_phone = settings.contact_phone | strip
      assign org_phone_first = org_phone | slice: 0
      if org_phone_first == '0'
        assign org_phone = org_phone | remove_first: '0' | prepend: '+972-'
      endif
    -%}
    {%- capture org_branches -%}{%- render 'branches-json' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture org_json -%}
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "Organization",
        "@id": {{ org_id | json }},
        "name": {{ brand_name | json }}
        {%- if org_alternate_name != blank and org_alternate_name != brand_name -%},"alternateName": {{ org_alternate_name | json }}{%- endif -%},
        "url": {{ site_url | append: routes.root_url | json }}
        {%- if org_logo != blank -%}
          {%- assign org_logo_url = org_logo | image_url: width: 600 | remove_first: 'https:' | prepend: 'https:' -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- assign org_logo_url = 'logo-joy.png' | asset_url | remove_first: 'https:' | prepend: 'https:' -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        ,"logo": {{ org_logo_url | json }},
        "image": {{ org_logo_url | json }},
        "description": {{ org_description | json }}
        {%- if org_phone != blank -%}
          ,"telephone": {{ org_phone | json }}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if org_email != blank -%}
          ,"email": {{ org_email | json }}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if settings.store_street != blank or settings.store_city != blank -%}
          ,"address": {
            "@type": "PostalAddress",
            "streetAddress": {{ settings.store_street | json }},
            "addressLocality": {{ settings.store_city | json }}
            {%- if settings.store_zip != blank -%},"postalCode": {{ settings.store_zip | json }}{%- endif -%},
            "addressCountry": "IL"
          }
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if org_phone != blank or org_email != blank -%}
          ,"contactPoint": [{
            "@type": "ContactPoint",
            "contactType": "customer service",
            {%- if org_phone != blank -%}"telephone": {{ org_phone | json }},{%- endif -%}
            {%- if org_email != blank -%}"email": {{ org_email | json }},{%- endif -%}
            "availableLanguage": "he"
          }]
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if same_as_list.size > 0 -%}
          ,"sameAs": {{ same_as_list | json }}
        {%- endif -%}
        ,"hasMerchantReturnPolicy": {{ return_policy_json }}
        {%- if org_branches != blank -%}
          ,"department": [{{ org_branches }}]
        {%- endif -%}
      }
    {%- endcapture -%}
    <script type="application/ld+json">{{ org_json | strip_newlines | replace: '</', '<\/' }}</script>

  {%- when 'website' -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign search_template = site_url | append: routes.search_url | append: '?q={search_term_string}'
      assign website_alternate_name = 'general.meta.alternate_name' | t | strip
    -%}
    {%- capture website_json -%}
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "WebSite",
        "@id": {{ site_url | append: '/#website' | json }},
        "name": {{ brand_name | json }}
        {%- if website_alternate_name != blank and website_alternate_name != brand_name -%},"alternateName": {{ website_alternate_name | json }}{%- endif -%},
        "url": {{ site_url | append: routes.root_url | json }},
        "inLanguage": "he",
        "publisher": { "@id": {{ org_id | json }} },
        "potentialAction": {
          "@type": "SearchAction",
          "target": {
            "@type": "EntryPoint",
            "urlTemplate": {{ search_template | json }}
          },
          "query-input": "required name=search_term_string"
        }
      }
    {%- endcapture -%}
    <script type="application/ld+json">{{ website_json | strip_newlines | replace: '</', '<\/' }}</script>

  {%- when 'product' -%}
    {%- if placement == 'head' and product != blank -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign ld_product = product
        assign ld_url = site_url | append: ld_product.url
        assign ld_currency = cart.currency.iso_code | default: shop.currency
        assign ld_first = ld_product.selected_or_first_available_variant
        assign ld_multiple = false
        if ld_product.variants.size > 1
          assign ld_multiple = true
        endif

        assign ld_vendor = ld_product.vendor | strip
        assign ld_vendor_key = ld_vendor | downcase
        assign ld_shop_key = shop.name | strip | downcase
        assign ld_brand_key = brand_name | downcase
        assign ld_brand = ''
        if ld_vendor != blank and ld_vendor_key != ld_shop_key and ld_vendor_key != ld_brand_key
          assign ld_brand = ld_vendor
        endif

        assign ld_condition = 'https://schema.org/NewCondition'
        if ld_product.tags contains 'יד שניה' or ld_product.tags contains 'יד שנייה'
          assign ld_condition = 'https://schema.org/UsedCondition'
        elsif ld_product.tags contains 'מחודש'
          assign ld_condition = 'https://schema.org/RefurbishedCondition'
        endif

        assign ld_color = ''
        assign ld_colour_options = 'צבע,גוון,צבעים,color,colour,colors' | split: ','
        for ld_option in ld_product.options_with_values
          assign ld_option_probe = ld_option.name | downcase | strip
          if ld_colour_options contains ld_option_probe
            assign ld_color = ld_first.options[forloop.index0] | strip
            break
          endif
        endfor
        if ld_color == blank
          # Same words as am_colours in snippets/accessory-model, minus the band names מילנז/מילנזי.
          assign ld_colour_words = 'שחור,לבן,כחול,תכלת,כתום,ורוד,אדום,ירוק,סגול,אפור,זהב,כסוף,כסף,סילבר,צהוב,חום,בורדו,ברונזה,קרם,לילך,בז׳,טבעי,מדברי,שמנת,שמפניה,מוקה,אור כוכבים,תיטניום,טיטניום,כהה,בהיר' | split: ','
          assign ld_colour_modifiers = 'כהה,בהיר,טבעי,מדברי' | split: ','
          assign ld_colour_core = false
          assign ld_previous_word = ''
          assign ld_title_words = ld_product.title | split: ' – ' | first | split: ' - ' | first | replace: 'אור כוכבים', 'אור␟כוכבים' | split: ' '
          for ld_title_word in ld_title_words
            if ld_previous_word != 'מתג'
              # "שחור/אפור" is one colour combination; its parts are checked one by one.
              assign ld_word_colours = ''
              assign ld_word_parts = ld_title_word | split: '/'
              for ld_word_part in ld_word_parts
                assign ld_colour_word = ld_word_part | replace: '␟', ' '
                if ld_colour_words contains ld_colour_word
                  if ld_word_colours != blank
                    assign ld_word_colours = ld_word_colours | append: '/'
                  endif
                  assign ld_word_colours = ld_word_colours | append: ld_colour_word
                  unless ld_colour_modifiers contains ld_colour_word
                    assign ld_colour_core = true
                  endunless
                endif
              endfor
              if ld_word_colours != blank
                assign ld_color = ld_color | append: ' ' | append: ld_word_colours | strip
              endif
            endif
            assign ld_previous_word = ld_title_word
          endfor
          if ld_colour_core == false
            assign ld_color = ''
          endif
        endif

        # 30 days (2,592,000 seconds) from the render.
        assign ld_price_valid_until = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 2592000 | date: '%Y-%m-%d'
        assign ld_store_type = settings.store_business_type | default: 'ElectronicsStore'
      -%}
      {%- capture ld_branches -%}{%- render 'branches-json' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture ld_stores -%}
        {%- assign ld_branch_parts = ld_branches | split: '#store-' -%}
        {%- for ld_branch_part in ld_branch_parts offset: 1 -%}
          {%- assign ld_branch_id = ld_branch_part | split: '"' | first -%}
          {%- unless forloop.first %},{% endunless -%}
          {"@type":{{ ld_store_type | json }},"@id":{{ site_url | append: '/#store-' | append: ld_branch_id | json }}}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture ld_seller -%}{"@type":"Organization","@id":{{ org_id | json }},"name":{{ brand_name | json }}}{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture ld_description -%}{%- render 'plain-text', html: ld_product.description, limit: 5000 -%}{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- capture ld_offers -%}
        {%- assign ld_offer_count = 0 -%}
        {%- assign ld_product_gtin_key = '' -%}
        {%- for ld_variant in ld_product.variants limit: 100 -%}
          {%- if ld_variant.price > 0 -%}
            {%- liquid
              # GS1 check digit: from the digit before the check digit leftwards, weights 3, 1, 3, 1…
              assign ld_gtin = ld_variant.barcode | strip
              assign ld_gtin_key = ''
              assign ld_gtin_rest = ld_gtin | remove: '0' | remove: '1' | remove: '2' | remove: '3' | remove: '4' | remove: '5' | remove: '6' | remove: '7' | remove: '8' | remove: '9'
              if ld_gtin != blank and ld_gtin_rest == blank
                case ld_gtin.size
                  when 8, 12, 13, 14
                    assign ld_gtin_last = ld_gtin.size | minus: 1
                    assign ld_gtin_sum = 0
                    for ld_gtin_step in (1..ld_gtin_last)
                      assign ld_gtin_position = ld_gtin_last | minus: ld_gtin_step
                      assign ld_gtin_digit = ld_gtin | slice: ld_gtin_position | plus: 0
                      assign ld_gtin_weight = ld_gtin_step | modulo: 2 | times: 2 | plus: 1
                      assign ld_gtin_sum = ld_gtin_digit | times: ld_gtin_weight | plus: ld_gtin_sum
                    endfor
                    assign ld_gtin_remainder = ld_gtin_sum | modulo: 10
                    assign ld_gtin_check = 10 | minus: ld_gtin_remainder | modulo: 10
                    assign ld_gtin_actual = ld_gtin | slice: ld_gtin_last | plus: 0
                    if ld_gtin_check == ld_gtin_actual
                      assign ld_gtin_key = 'gtin' | append: ld_gtin.size
                    endif
                endcase
              endif
              if ld_multiple == false and ld_gtin_key != blank
                assign ld_product_gtin_key = ld_gtin_key
                assign ld_product_gtin = ld_gtin
              endif
            -%}
            {%- if ld_offer_count > 0 -%},{%- endif -%}
            {%- assign ld_offer_count = ld_offer_count | plus: 1 -%}
            {
              "@type": "Offer",
              "url": {{ ld_url | append: '?variant=' | append: ld_variant.id | json }},
              "price": {{ ld_variant.price | divided_by: 100.0 | json }},
              "priceCurrency": {{ ld_currency | json }},
              "availability": {% if ld_variant.available %}"https://schema.org/InStock"{% else %}"https://schema.org/OutOfStock"{% endif %},
              "itemCondition": {{ ld_condition | json }},
              "priceValidUntil": {{ ld_price_valid_until | json }},
              "seller": {{ ld_seller }},
              "hasMerchantReturnPolicy": {{ return_policy_json }}
              {%- if ld_stores != blank -%},"availableAtOrFrom": [{{ ld_stores }}]{%- endif -%}
              {%- if settings.schema_pickup_only -%}
                ,"availableDeliveryMethod": "https://schema.org/OnSitePickup",
                "shippingDetails": {"@type":"OfferShippingDetails","doesNotShip":true,"shippingDestination":{"@type":"DefinedRegion","addressCountry":"IL"}}
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if ld_multiple -%},"name": {{ ld_product.title | append: ' – ' | append: ld_variant.title | json }}{%- endif -%}
              {%- if ld_variant.sku != blank -%},"sku": {{ ld_variant.sku | strip | json }}{%- endif -%}
              {%- if ld_gtin_key != blank -%},{{ ld_gtin_key | json }}: {{ ld_gtin | json }}{%- endif -%}
            }
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endcapture -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        Category: the product type, with the POS department codes (א.… = accessories, מ.… = console games)
        spelled out; a code that is not a readable category is left out.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign ld_type = ld_product.type | strip
        case ld_type
          when 'מכשירים'
            assign ld_category = 'סמארטפונים'
          when 'שעונים'
            assign ld_category = 'שעונים חכמים'
          when 'מולטימדיה ושמע'
            assign ld_category = 'שמע ומולטימדיה'
          when 'א.מכשירים'
            assign ld_category = 'אביזרים לסמארטפונים'
          when 'א.טאבלטים'
            assign ld_category = 'אביזרים לטאבלטים'
          when 'א.מחשבים'
            assign ld_category = 'אביזרי מחשב וגיימינג'
          when 'א.קונסולות'
            assign ld_category = 'אביזרים לקונסולות'
          when 'א.רכב'
            assign ld_category = 'אביזרים לרכב'
          when 'א.שעונים'
            assign ld_category = 'אביזרים לשעונים חכמים'
          when 'א.אוזניות'
            assign ld_category = 'אביזרים לאוזניות'
          when 'א.מצלמות'
            assign ld_category = 'אביזרים למצלמות'
          when 'א.אלקטרוניקה'
            assign ld_category = 'אביזרי אלקטרוניקה'
          when 'א.שואבים'
            assign ld_category = 'אביזרים לשואבי אבק'
          when 'מ.קונסולות'
            assign ld_category = 'משחקי קונסולה'
          else
            assign ld_category = ld_type
            if ld_type contains '.' or ld_type contains 'חייבים' or ld_type == 'TheLeeBox'
              assign ld_category = ''
            endif
        endcase
      -%}
      {%- capture product_json -%}
        {
          "@context": "https://schema.org",
          "@type": "Product",
          "@id": {{ ld_url | append: '#product' | json }},
          "name": {{ ld_product.title | json }},
          "url": {{ ld_url | json }}
          {%- if ld_description != blank -%},"description": {{ ld_description | json }}{%- endif -%}
          {%- if ld_product.images.size > 0 -%}
            ,"image": [
              {%- for ld_image in ld_product.images limit: 8 -%}
                {{ ld_image | image_url: width: 1200 | remove_first: 'https:' | prepend: 'https:' | json }}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
              {%- endfor -%}
            ]
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if ld_first.sku != blank -%},"sku": {{ ld_first.sku | strip | json }}{%- endif -%}
          {%- if ld_product_gtin_key != blank -%},{{ ld_product_gtin_key | json }}: {{ ld_product_gtin | json }}{%- endif -%}
          {%- if ld_brand != blank -%},"brand": { "@type": "Brand", "name": {{ ld_brand | json }} }{%- endif -%}
          {%- if ld_category != blank -%},"category": {{ ld_category | json }}{%- endif -%}
          {%- if ld_color != blank -%},"color": {{ ld_color | json }}{%- endif -%}
          {%- if ld_offer_count > 0 -%},"offers": [{{ ld_offers }}]{%- endif -%}
        }
      {%- endcapture -%}
      <script type="application/ld+json">{{ product_json | strip_newlines | replace: '</', '<\/' }}</script>

      {%- comment -%}
        FAQPage from the description's questions and answers: an <h3> that ends with "?" is a question and the
        text up to the next heading is its answer (the same rule as the category pages). Only with at least two.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if ld_product.description contains '<h3' -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign ld_faq_json = ''
          assign ld_faq_count = 0
          assign ld_faq_parts = ld_product.description | split: '<h3'
          for ld_faq_part in ld_faq_parts offset: 1
            assign ld_faq_q_html = ld_faq_part | split: '</h3>' | first | remove_first: '>'
            capture ld_faq_q
              render 'plain-text', html: ld_faq_q_html
            endcapture
            assign ld_faq_q = ld_faq_q | strip
            assign ld_faq_mark = ld_faq_q | slice: -1
            if ld_faq_mark != '?'
              continue
            endif
            assign ld_faq_rest = ld_faq_part | split: '</h3>' | last | split: '<h2' | first
            capture ld_faq_a
              render 'plain-text', html: ld_faq_rest
            endcapture
            assign ld_faq_a = ld_faq_a | strip
            if ld_faq_a != blank
              assign ld_faq_count = ld_faq_count | plus: 1
              assign ld_faq_q_json = ld_faq_q | json
              assign ld_faq_a_json = ld_faq_a | json
              if ld_faq_json != blank
                assign ld_faq_json = ld_faq_json | append: ','
              endif
              assign ld_faq_json = ld_faq_json | append: '{"@type":"Question","name":' | append: ld_faq_q_json | append: ',"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":' | append: ld_faq_a_json | append: '}}'
            endif
          endfor
        -%}
        {%- if ld_faq_count > 1 -%}
          <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{{ ld_faq_json | replace: '</', '<\/' }}]}</script>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}

  {%- when 'article' -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign ld_article = article
      assign article_url = site_url | append: ld_article.url
      assign article_summary = ld_article.excerpt_or_content | replace: '<', ' <' | strip_html | split: ' ' | join: ' ' | truncate: 300
    -%}
    {%- if ld_article != blank -%}
      {%- capture article_json -%}
        {
          "@context": "https://schema.org",
          "@type": "BlogPosting",
          "@id": {{ article_url | append: '#article' | json }},
          "mainEntityOfPage": {{ article_url | json }},
          "headline": {{ ld_article.title | truncate: 110 | json }},
          "description": {{ article_summary | json }},
          "inLanguage": "he",
          "datePublished": {{ ld_article.published_at | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S%z' | json }},
          "dateModified": {{ ld_article.updated_at | default: ld_article.published_at | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S%z' | json }},
          "author": { "@type": "Person", "name": {{ ld_article.author | default: brand_name | json }} },
          "publisher": { "@id": {{ org_id | json }} }
          {%- if ld_article.image != blank -%}
            ,"image": {{ ld_article.image | image_url: width: 1200 | remove_first: 'https:' | prepend: 'https:' | json }}
          {%- endif -%}
        }
      {%- endcapture -%}
      <script type="application/ld+json">{{ article_json | strip_newlines | replace: '</', '<\/' }}</script>
    {%- endif -%}
{%- endcase -%}
